Save the files pst-ovl.sty|.tex| in a directory, which is part of your 
local TeX ovl. Then do not forget to run texhash to update this ovl
if these packages are new to your TeX distribution.

pst-ovl needs pstricks, which should be part of your
local TeX installation, otherwise get it from a CTAN server, f.ex.
http://mirror.ctan.org/graphics/pstricks/


